      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791265598393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Stages (none can be skipped):  1 firewall  →  2 investigate  →  3 size  →  4 review  →  5 execute  →  6 complete     (detail: board C)\nGemini reads the account with MCP-backed read tools and ends with one decision: answer · propose_actions · propose_leverage · propose_unwind · ask_user · decline.\nCode validates the decision, sizes every amount from live data with the protocol maths, freezes the plan (digest, 5 min) and runs it step by step.\n\nRead  —  “How much more can I borrow?”  get_capacity → answer with figures from the evidence only.\nWrite —  “Put 100 USDC and 1 SOL into earn”  propose_actions → two Earn supply steps → approve → wallet signs each → confirmed.\nPlan  —  “Lever my SOL 2x with USDC”  propose_leverage → borrow (N−1)×equity, margin swap, report; every step re-checked at the 1.15 floor.",
      "originalText": "Stages (none can be skipped):  1 firewall  →  2 investigate  →  3 size  →  4 review  →  5 execute  →  6 complete     (detail: board C)\nGemini reads the account with MCP-backed read tools and ends with one decision: answer · propose_actions · propose_leverage · propose_unwind · ask_user · decline.\nCode validates the decision, sizes every amount from live data with the protocol maths, freezes the plan (digest, 5 min) and runs it step by step.\n\nRead  —  “How much more can I borrow?”  get_capacity → answer with figures from the evidence only.\nWrite —  “Put 100 USDC and 1 SOL into earn”  propose_actions → two Earn supply steps → approve → wallet signs each → confirmed.\nPlan  —  “Lever my SOL 2x with USDC”  propose_leverage → borrow (N−1)×equity, margin swap, report; every step re-checked at the 1.15 floor.",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "baseline": 81,
      "index": "ax"
    },
    {
      "id": "el00612588",
      "x": 60,
      "y": 1010,
      "width": 2120,
      "height": 520,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "#f8f9fa",
