      "text": "Not offered: Sign Service, auto-sign, admin tools, liquidation execution, perps / shorts, conditional orders, mainnet.\nSolana vs Stellar: same stages and the same use of Gemini. Different signing (wallet only), login (SIWS), venues (Kamino + Jupiter), fork prices (keeper).",
