      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "index": "b0rVK",
      "text": "Stage 2 — investigation loop   (Gemini thinking MEDIUM first, LOW on follow-up turns · up to 6 turns · 16 reads · 50 s · 15 s per read)\nRead tools (MCP-backed; the wallet comes from the session, never from the model):\nget_account_health · get_positions · get_wallet_balances · get_prices · get_pool_rates\nget_earn_positions · get_earn_interest · get_kamino_markets · get_kamino_positions · get_capacity · what_if\nget_leverage_capacity · get_liquidation_risk · get_swap_quote · get_history · get_protocol_info · explain_concept\nDecision tools: answer · propose_actions · propose_leverage · propose_unwind · ask_user · decline\nChecks on every decision: product guards (intent.ts) · literal amounts must be typed by the user ·\nanswer figures must appear in a tool result · a rejected decision goes back to Gemini for the next turn",
      "originalText": "Stage 2 — investigation loop   (Gemini thinking MEDIUM first, LOW on follow-up turns · up to 6 turns · 16 reads · 50 s · 15 s per read)\nRead tools (MCP-backed; the wallet comes from the session, never from the model):\nget_account_health · get_positions · get_wallet_balances · get_prices · get_pool_rates\nget_earn_positions · get_earn_interest · get_kamino_markets · get_kamino_positions · get_capacity · what_if\nget_leverage_capacity · get_liquidation_risk · get_swap_quote · get_history · get_protocol_info · explain_concept\nDecision tools: answer · propose_actions · propose_leverage · propose_unwind · ask_user · decline\nChecks on every decision: product guards (intent.ts) · literal amounts must be typed by the user ·\nanswer figures must appear in a tool result · a rejected decision goes back to Gemini for the next turn",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "st000181660",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": false,
      "baseline": 11
    },
