      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "index": "b0rVM",
      "text": "Stage 3 — sizing words → exact amounts\nliteral → the user's number (checked)\nfraction → % of the balance (resolvePercent)\nall → the whole balance or debt, at build time\nmax_safe → largest safe borrow / withdrawal (sizeSafeBorrow, sizeSafeWithdraw)\nprevious_leg → the previous step's amount\nleverage → borrow = base × (N − 1)   (sizeLevBorrow)\nreceive → swap input sized from live quotes   (sizeExactOut)\nStrategies: planLever (deposit → borrow stable → margin swap → report) · planUnwind",
      "originalText": "Stage 3 — sizing words → exact amounts\nliteral → the user's number (checked)\nfraction → % of the balance (resolvePercent)\nall → the whole balance or debt, at build time\nmax_safe → largest safe borrow / withdrawal (sizeSafeBorrow, sizeSafeWithdraw)\nprevious_leg → the previous step's amount\nleverage → borrow = base × (N − 1)   (sizeLevBorrow)\nreceive → swap input sized from live quotes   (sizeExactOut)\nStrategies: planLever (deposit → borrow stable → margin swap → report) · planUnwind",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "st000203778",
