      "seed": 278339389,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 2088760521,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1791265598393,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "type": "text",
      "index": "b0rVS",
      "text": "Protocol maths   (vanna_credit_layer math/health.rs · app lib/margin · lib/copilot/risk.ts)\nvalue = amount × oracle price (no haircut)   ·   HF = collateral ÷ debt\nborrow needs HF > 1.10  ·  liquidation at HF ≤ 1.10  ·  Copilot floor 1.15\nsafe borrow = (C − F·D) ÷ (F − 1)   ·   safe withdrawal = C − F·D\nleverage = collateral ÷ equity   ·   N x on a deposit: borrow = deposit × (N − 1)\nlever N x: borrow (N − 1) × equity, HF checked at 1% worst-case slippage  ·  max on a fresh deposit F ÷ (F − 1) ≈ 7.66x",
