      "text": "Always on\nHard refusals run before Gemini: liquidation, admin, faucet, transfers, perps / shorts, other wallets, other tokens\nGemini unreachable or out of budget → keyword router (router.ts) with the same guards and lanes\nLimits: no USD cap per action or day unless set · 6 builds per minute · 20 chats per minute · 8 steps per plan\nThe model never sees a transaction and never signs; the wallet signs every step",
